  "figureNotes": [
    "td-9867: 26 CFR 54.9831-1(c)(3)(viii) and 54.9802-4 apply to plan years beginning on or after January 1, 2020",
    "n-17-67 footnote 5: \"This adjustment increased the $10,000 limit to $10,050 for a QSEHRA provided in 2017; the adjustment did not increase the $4,950 limit for 2017.\" IRC 9831(d)(2)(B)(iii) states $4,950 ($10,000 for family members) and (d)(2)(D)(ii) indexes both for years beginning after 2016 from a 2015 base, rounded down to $50 (usc-26-9831)",
    "rp-17-58, Qualified Small Employer Health Reimbursement Arrangement: the arrangement \"cannot exceed $5,050 ($10,250 for family coverage)\" for 2018",
    "rp-18-57, Qualified Small Employer Health Reimbursement Arrangement: the arrangement \"cannot exceed $5,150 ($10,450 for family coverage)\" for 2019",
    "td-9867, 26 CFR 54.9831-1(c)(3)(viii)(B)(1): amounts newly made available for each plan year \"do not exceed $1,800\", increased for plan years beginning after December 31, 2020 by the C-CPI-U over calendar year 2019 and rounded down to a multiple of $50",
    "td-9867: 26 CFR 54.9802-4 applies to plan years beginning on or after January 1, 2020 and states no dollar limit outside its examples",
    "rp-19-44, Qualified Small Employer Health Reimbursement Arrangement: the arrangement \"cannot exceed $5,250 ($10,600 for family coverage)\" for 2020",
    "rp-20-43 section 1: the indexed maximum \"will not change for plan years beginning after December 31, 2020, and before January 1, 2022, and remains $1,800\"",
    "rp-20-45, Qualified Small Employer Health Reimbursement Arrangement: the arrangement \"cannot exceed $5,300 ($10,700 for family coverage)\" for 2021",
    "rp-21-25 section 2.02 or 3.02: \"For plan years beginning in 2022, the maximum amount that may be made newly available for the plan year for an excepted benefit HRA under § 54.9831-1(c)(3)(viii) is $1,800\"",
    "rp-21-45, Qualified Small Employer Health Reimbursement Arrangement: the arrangement \"cannot exceed $5,450 ($11,050 for family coverage)\" for 2022",
    "rp-22-24 section 2.02 or 3.02: \"For plan years beginning in 2023, the maximum amount that may be made newly available for the plan year for an excepted benefit HRA under § 54.9831-1(c)(3)(viii) is $1,950\"",
    "rp-22-38, Qualified Small Employer Health Reimbursement Arrangement: the arrangement \"cannot exceed $5,850 ($11,800 for family coverage)\" for 2023",
    "rp-23-23 section 2.02 or 3.02: \"For plan years beginning in 2024, the maximum amount that may be made newly available for the plan year for an excepted benefit HRA under § 54.9831-1(c)(3)(viii) is $2,100\"",
    "rp-23-34, Qualified Small Employer Health Reimbursement Arrangement: the arrangement \"cannot exceed $6,150 ($12,450 for family coverage)\" for 2024",
    "rp-24-25 section 2.02 or 3.02: \"For plan years beginning in 2025, the maximum amount that may be made newly available for the plan year for an excepted benefit HRA under § 54.9831-1(c)(3)(viii) is $2,150\"",
    "rp-24-40, Qualified Small Employer Health Reimbursement Arrangement: the arrangement \"cannot exceed $6,350 ($12,800 for family coverage)\" for 2025",
    "rp-25-19 section 2.02 or 3.02: \"For plan years beginning in 2026, the maximum amount that may be made newly available for the plan year for an excepted benefit HRA under § 54.9831-1(c)(3)(viii) is $2,200\"",
    "rp-25-32, Qualified Small Employer Health Reimbursement Arrangement: the arrangement \"cannot exceed $6,450 ($13,100 for family coverage)\" for 2026"
